  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "AA1A4CEB935F69A4",
      "text": "Hello, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "AA1A4FEB935F6EBD",
      "text": "Good evening, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "AA1A4EEB935F6D0A",
      "text": "We are very grateful for all you did to help clear\\nup that horrible confusion over dear Ogerpon.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "AA1A49EB935F648B",
      "text": "I never dreamt that the “Loyal Three” were in the\\nwrong—and that poor Ogerpon was the victim![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "AA1A48EB935F62D8",
      "text": "Why, we would have gone on passing down the\\nwrong story without a second thought![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "AA1A4BEB935F67F1",
      "text": "All that being said![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "AA1A4AEB935F663E",
      "text": "While I do fully understand that the Loyal Three\\nwere villains...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "AA1A45EB935F5DBF",
      "text": "You’ve seen the state of Loyalty Plaza, yes?\\c\\nThe statues are ruined—shattered to pieces when\\nthose three were resurrected!\\c\\nDoesn’t it pain your heart to see it so?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 169,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "AA1A44EB935F5C0C",
      "text": "And only too right! I knew a student of a fine\\nacademy like yours must appreciate the\\r\\nsignificance of such a site![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "AA1747EB935D2B4E",
      "text": "Oh? You DID see what that place looked like\\nbefore the monument was destroyed, didn’t you?\\c\\nI’m sure you mourn for the loss of such a site,\\neven if your words tell another story.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 180,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "AA1748EB935D2D01",
      "text": "Yes, the actual “Loyal Three” were in the wrong.\\nBut the monument brought so many touri—\\c\\nI mean, it brought so much comfort and hope to\\nthe people of our village for generations.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "AA1745EB935D27E8",
      "text": "Which is why...\\c\\nI have begun a fundraiser to restore that beloved\\nsite to its former state—and I am calling it the\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]“We Love Loyalty Plaza” drive[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_13",
      "hash64": "AA1746EB935D299B",
      "text": "We are looking for donations of 10,000, with\\nthe ultimate goal of gathering 1,000,000![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_14",
      "hash64": "AA174BEB935D321A",
      "text": "Be that as it may, I couldn’t possibly take that\\nkind of money from a student such as yourself...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_15",
      "hash64": "AA174CEB935D33CD",
      "text": "But perhaps you could subtly nudge your parents\\nor teachers to contribute to our cause![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_16",
      "hash64": "AA1749EB935D2EB4",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]We’ve collected a total of [VAR 0x0206(0001,002C)] so far for\\nthe\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]“We Love Loyalty Plaza” drive[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0206",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "002C"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_select_01",
      "hash64": "D3AA8208D3BA4BC0",
      "text": "I’ll give [VAR 0xBD03(0000)]10,000",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD03",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_select_02",
      "hash64": "D3AA8508D3BA50D9",
      "text": "I’ll give [VAR 0xBD03(0000)]100,000",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD03",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_select_03",
      "hash64": "D3AA8408D3BA4F26",
      "text": "Maybe next time",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_17",
      "hash64": "AA174AEB935D3067",
      "text": "You’d be so kind as to give 10,000 to our\\nfundraiser?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_18",
      "hash64": "AA173FEB935D1DB6",
      "text": "Goodness me! You really wish to give us an\\nentire 100,000 at once?![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_19",
      "hash64": "AA1740EB935D1F69",
      "text": "We’ll reach that 1,000,000 in due time—\\nyou’ll see! And I’ll be here until we do![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_20",
      "hash64": "AA13C1EB935A11C5",
      "text": "It seems you don’t have enough money to make\\nthat sort of donation...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_21",
      "hash64": "AA13C0EB935A1012",
      "text": "Well, I accept your kind support with gratitude!\\nAnd here—a little something for you in return.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_22",
      "hash64": "AA13BFEB935A0E5F",
      "text": "Our goal is to raise a total of 1,000,000, and\\nwe’ve raised [VAR 0x0206(0001,002C)] so far![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0206",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "002C"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_23",
      "hash64": "AA13BEEB935A0CAC",
      "text": "With that donation— O-oh my...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_38",
      "hash64": "AA1043EB935705D4",
      "text": "We’ve reached our goal of 1,000,000![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_24",
      "hash64": "AA13BDEB935A0AF9",
      "text": "Now we can at last restore Loyalty Plaza to the\\nway it was![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_25",
      "hash64": "AA13BCEB935A0946",
      "text": "Let me call our contractor at once...\\n*beep* *boop* *beep* *beep*[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_26",
      "hash64": "AA13BBEB935A0793",
      "text": "Hello? Yes, yes, it’s me again. We were able to\\nraise the funds for the project!\\c\\nWe’d love to see work get started at once![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_27",
      "hash64": "AA13BAEB935A05E0",
      "text": "They say they’re already done! Why don’t we\\nhead over to see the fruits of your labor?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_28",
      "hash64": "AA13C9EB935A1F5D",
      "text": "Ohhh... Would you just look—![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
