      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_32",
      "hash64": "AA103DEB9356FBA2",
      "text": "This is just what the village needed!\\c\\nYes, just what we needed...to draw in more\\ntourists who’ll want to take photos here!\\c\\nWe’ll be topping the tourism charts in no time![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
